{
    "title": "Ball Sort - Color Puz Game",
    "description": "\ud83d\udd34\ud83d\udfe1\ud83d\udd35 Ball Sort - Color Puz Game \ud83d\udfe2\ud83d\udfe3\ud83d\udfe0 is an interesting color ball sorting game. While playing this game, you can not only relax and relieve stress, but also exercise your brain. Every time the colored balls are sorted and fill each tube, the sense of relaxation it brings will relieve stress and keep you away from daily worries. Ball Sort - Color Puz Game is definitely your best choice for exercising your brain and cultivating logical thinking.\r\n\r\n\u2728\u2728HOW TO PLAY\u2728\u2728 \r\n\u26bd Tap a tube to pick up the top ball, then tap another tube to move it.\r\n\ud83e\udd4e balls can only be placed on top of another balls when the two balls are the same color and the tube has enough space.\r\n\ud83c\udfd0The rule is to put all the balls of the same color in one tube to complete the level.\r\n\ud83c\udfc0 Use \"undo\" to go back to the previous steps.\r\n\ud83c\udfb1 If you get stuck, you can add an extra tube.\r\n\u26be You can restart the level at any time.\r\n \r\n\u2728\u2728 FEATURES \u2728\u2728\r\n\ud83e\udd29 One finger control, simple but addictive gameplay\r\n\ud83c\udd93 FREE & EASY TO PLAY.\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Thousands of levels to challenge\r\n\u2615 No penalty, you can restart the current level at any time\r\n\ud83e\uddea Use \"undo\" to go back to the previous steps, or click \"Add\" to add an extra tube\r\n\u23f3 NO time limit, enjoy Ball Sort - Color Puz Game at your own pace\r\n\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66  Family game, suitable for all ages\r\n\ud83d\udcf6  OFFLINE game, No internet needed\r\n\r\nGet ready to dive into a colorful gaming experience with Ball Sort - Color Puz Game! Download now and join the fun with your family and friends. Who will emerge as the ultimate color sorting master?",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udd34\ud83d\udfe1\ud83d\udd35 Ball Sort - Color Puz Game \ud83d\udfe2\ud83d\udfe3\ud83d\udfe0 is an interesting color ball sorting game. While playing this game, you can not only relax and relieve stress, but also exercise your brain. Every time the colored balls are sorted and fill each tube, the sense of relaxation it brings will relieve stress and keep you away from daily worries. Ball Sort - Color Puz Game is definitely your best choice for exercising your brain and cultivating logical thinking.<br><br>\u2728\u2728HOW TO PLAY\u2728\u2728 <br>\u26bd Tap a tube to pick up the top ball, then tap another tube to move it.<br>\ud83e\udd4e balls can only be placed on top of another balls when the two balls are the same color and the tube has enough space.<br>\ud83c\udfd0The rule is to put all the balls of the same color in one tube to complete the level.<br>\ud83c\udfc0 Use &quot;undo&quot; to go back to the previous steps.<br>\ud83c\udfb1 If you get stuck, you can add an extra tube.<br>\u26be You can restart the level at any time.<br> <br>\u2728\u2728 FEATURES \u2728\u2728<br>\ud83e\udd29 One finger control, simple but addictive gameplay<br>\ud83c\udd93 FREE &amp; EASY TO PLAY.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Thousands of levels to challenge<br>\u2615 No penalty, you can restart the current level at any time<br>\ud83e\uddea Use &quot;undo&quot; to go back to the previous steps, or click &quot;Add&quot; to add an extra tube<br>\u23f3 NO time limit, enjoy Ball Sort - Color Puz Game at your own pace<br>\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66  Family game, suitable for all ages<br>\ud83d\udcf6  OFFLINE game, No internet needed<br><br>Get ready to dive into a colorful gaming experience with Ball Sort - Color Puz Game! Download now and join the fun with your family and friends. Who will emerge as the ultimate color sorting master?",
